Graphics => Graphics / 图形设置


FPScounter => FPS counter / 数据显示

showFPS => Show your FPS / 显示当前帧数
showExtra => Show more data / 显示更多性能数值
rainbowFPS => Change color with FPS / 字体颜色跟随帧数进行变化
memoryType => Memory showcase data / 运存展示数据类型
fpsScale => Size / FPS大小
fpsDisplayMode => Switches the performance counter between TPS and FPS / 切换性能计数器显示 TPS 或 FPS


Watermark => Watermark / 水印设置

showWatermark => Visible / 显示水印
watermarkScale => Scale / 水印大小
